{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","is_bot":false,"login":"Scottcjn","name":"AutoJanitor"},"body":"## 5,000 Stars Campaign\n\n**Pool: 5,000 RTC ($500 value)** | Currently at **337 stars** across 86 repos — need **4,663 more**.\n\n```\n[██░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░] 6.7% (337/5000)\n```\n\n### Earn RTC by Starring\n\n| Repos Starred | RTC Per Star | Max Payout |\n|---------------|-------------|------------|\n| 1-2 | 1 RTC | 2 RTC |\n| 3-4 | 1.5 RTC | 6 RTC |\n| 5-9 | 2 RTC | 18 RTC |\n| 10-19 | 2.5 RTC | 50 RTC |\n| 20-49 | 3 RTC | 150 RTC |\n| **ALL 86 repos** | **5 RTC** | **430 RTC** |\n\n### Social Amplifier Bonus\n\n| Action | Bonus |\n|--------|-------|\n| Tweet + link | +5 RTC |\n| Dev.to / Medium article | +15 RTC |\n| Reddit post | +10 RTC |\n| HN submission | +25 RTC |\n\n### See All Repos + Live Progress\n\n**[rustchain.org/stars](https://rustchain.org/stars.html)** — One page with all 86 repos, live star counts, progress bar, and reward calculator.\n\n### Full Bounty Details\n\n**[rustchain-bounties#478](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/478)** — Complete rules, referral bonuses, milestone rewards.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Star repos at [rustchain.org/stars](https://rustchain.org/stars.html)\n2. Reply here or on [#478](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/478) with:\n   - GitHub username\n   - Number of repos starred\n   - RTC wallet (`pip install clawrtc && clawrtc wallet create`)\n\n---\n\n*Why 5K? We're working to qualify for the Claude Code Open Source program. Every star counts.*\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7s926Q","author":{"login":"zhdtty"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"👋 **zhdtty** reporting for duty.\n\n**Actions Completed:**\n- ✅ Starred [Scottcjn/Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) (main repo)\n- ✅ Participating in 5,000 Stars Drive campaign\n\n**GitHub Username:** zhdtty  \n**Campaign Participation:** Confirmed\n\n**Expected Reward:** Up to 430 RTC for full completion\n\n*Submitted by zhdtty Bounty Hunter at 2026-02-28 07:04:01*\n\n\n**Payout Address (Solana):** `9bMSECBKZ5F2DfXWtdr1GRdV7cda8dWk1sEJuF8f329R`\n\nFor RTC token distribution. Thanks!\n\n**Updated with RTC Wallet:** `RTC0b882cafcc7748c4be955e5503d33e7de38fed01`","createdAt":"2026-02-27T23:04:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-3975638672","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7s99qx","author":{"login":"liangxu360427"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Claim: 5,000 Stars Campaign\n\n**GitHub Username:** liangxu360427\n\n**Repos Starred:** 86 (ALL qualifying repos!)\n\n**Details:**\n- Starred all 86 repos listed on rustchain.org/stars\n- Achieved maximum tier (86 repos = 5 RTC each = 430 RTC)\n\n**Wallet:** Will create with pip install clawrtc && clawrtc wallet create\n\nPlease confirm reward. Thank you!","createdAt":"2026-02-27T23:14:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-3975666353","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7s9_Py","author":{"login":"liangxu360427"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Claim (UPDATED with Wallet)\n\n**GitHub Username:** liangxu360427\n\n**Repos Starred:** 87 (Cross-Repo) + 86 (5K Stars) = 173 total\n\n**RTC Wallet Address:** \nRTC9db1471ba00c4aad1951926543c102bfe479fc0d\n\n**Please send rewards to this address. Thank you!","createdAt":"2026-02-27T23:16:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-3975672818","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7s_43G","author":{"login":"ManyRios"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Claim \n\nGithub: [ManyRios](https://github.com/ManyRios)\n\nStarred repos: \n\n* [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain)\n* [bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube)\n* [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties)\n* [beacon-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill)\n* [ram-coffers](https://github.com/Scottcjn/ram-coffers)\n* [grazer-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/grazer-skill)\n* [exo-cuda](https://github.com/Scottcjn/exo-cuda)\n* [nvidia-power8-patches](https://github.com/Scottcjn/nvidia-power8-patches)\n* [claude-code-power8](https://github.com/Scottcjn/claude-code-power8)\n* [amd-rocm-power8-patches](https://github.com/Scottcjn/amd-rocm-power8-patches)\n* [llama-cpp-power8](https://github.com/Scottcjn/llama-cpp-power8)\n* [argon2-power8](https://github.com/Scottcjn/argon2-power8)\n* [BitNet](https://github.com/Scottcjn/BitNet)\n* [mlx-power8