ks! ⚖️","createdAt":"2026-03-03T14:23:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-3991418453","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7t_Paz","author":{"login":"AdnanMehr8"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @Scottcjn,\n\nI'm checking in on the outstanding payouts for **AdnanMehr8**.\n\n**1. Marketplace Action (PR #342)**:\nInitial payment (15 RTC) was received. The remainder (25 RTC) was pending the Action being live on the Marketplace. It is now live here: [RustChain Mining Status Badge Action](https://github.com/marketplace/actions/rustchain-mining-status-badges). Requesting the final **25 RTC** settlement.\n\n**2. URL Migration (#420)**:\nThis PR was approved and addresses the migration to the rustchain.org domain across all assets. Checking on the merge/payout status for this contribution.\n\n**3. Micro-Bounties (#256 & #245)**:\nI submitted claims for the **Fork + Profile** and **Follows** bonuses on 2026-02-22. Checking status for those as well.\n\n**Wallet:** \n\nThanks! ⚖️","createdAt":"2026-03-03T18:16:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-3992778419","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7t_RSu","author":{"login":"AdnanMehr8"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @Scottcjn, \n\nI am following up on the remaining **25 RTC** for bounty #256 (Marketplace Action). \n\n**Status Update:**\n- **Initial Work (PR #342)**: Merged (15 RTC paid).\n- **Current Requirement**: The full 40 RTC payout was pending the Action being live on the Marketplace. \n- **Live Now**: The [RustChain Mining Status Badge Action](https://github.com/marketplace/actions/rustchain-mining-status-badges) is verified and live.\n\nI'm also checking on the Micro-Bounty claims for **Fork/Pin (#256)** and **Follows (#245)** whi