se},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7vkLoC","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Star campaign claims from this week — acknowledged and queuing for verification:\n\n@edisonlv — 100 repos claimed, wallet `RTC5016bfd8abe01cb2bc0cc09b64c6d500dcec7ece`. Verifying star count.\n\n@vita901 — 113 repos claimed. Note: please use wallet name `vita901` (not the hex address you posted earlier — see #665 for details).\n\n@zhdtty @Asobu01 — To claim: star repos, then post proof. We verify actual GitHub stars, not just comments saying you did it. Welcome aboard\\!\n","createdAt":"2026-03-08T15:13:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019239426","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7vl_Pv","author":{"login":"MCH-Strategies"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #425\n\nOllama Connection Error: HTTPConnectionPool(host='localhost', port=11434): Max retries exceeded with url: /api/generate (Caused by NewConnectionError('<urllib3.connection.HTTPConnection object at 0x000001E24A392FB0>: Failed to establish a new connection: [WinError 10061] No connection could be made because the target machine actively refused it'))","createdAt":"2026-03-08T18:16:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019713007","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7vmNrj","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@MCH-Strategies Your bot appears to be malfunctioning — it's posting Ollama connection errors as bounty attempts across multiple repos. Please fix your integration before submitting claims.","createdAt":"2026-03-08T18:51:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019772131","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7vmO8u","author":{"login":"MCH-Strategies"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"On it. This was from a failed run this morning. I’m attempting to clean up this mess now.\r\n\r\nSorry for the noise.\r\n\r\nMichael\r\n\r\nOn Mar 8, 2026, at 11:52 AM, AutoJanitor ***@***.***> wrote:\r\n\r\n﻿\r\n[https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?s=20&v=4]Scottcjn left a comment (Scottcjn/Rustchain#425)<https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019772131>\r\n\r\n@MCH-Strategies<https://github.com/MCH-Strategies> Your bot appears to be malfunctioning — it's posting Ollama connection errors as bounty attempts across multiple repos. Please fix your integration before submitting claims.\r\n\r\n—\r\nReply to this email directly, view it on GitHub<https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019772131>, or unsubscribe<https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/BUN6254YZTWVTHOAKARDDDT4PXFOBAVCNFSM6AAAAACWCDZ4TCVHI2DSMVQWIX3LMV43OSLTON2WKQ3PNVWWK3TUHM2DAMJZG43TEMJTGE>.\r\nYou are receiving this because you were mentioned.Message ID: ***@***.***>\r\n","createdAt":"2026-03-08T18:55:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4019777326","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7v6Wsm","author":{"login":"ffran5dev"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Reward claim: 5000 Stars Campaign\nGitHub Username: ffran5dev\n\nStarred Repos: 86 (ALL of the available repos)\nTarget Followed: Yes (@Scottcjn)\n\nRTC Wallet: `RTC167778a6cd8007869e4e9248cec7f299cba2edc8`\n\nCode with agent mode verified.\nAwaiting payout.\n","createdAt":"2026-03-09T16:31:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4025051942","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7v6sTO","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Claim Rejected — Fraudulent Identity\n\nYour claim states your GitHub username is **golang**, which is the [official Go programming language organization](https://github.com/golang) — not a personal account. This is a fraudulent claim.\n\n### How to participate properly:\n- Use your real GitHub username when claiming bounties\n- Actually star the repos from your own account\n- Don't impersonate organizations or other users\n\nThis claim is rejected and your account is flagged.","createdAt":"2026-03-09T16:43:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4025140430","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7v9u1H","author":{"login":"ffran5dev"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@Scottcjn My apologies for the confusion. I was testing a locally built Python script to interact with the GitHub API and generate the claim template, and the script mistakenly pulled my local Windows `os.getlogin()` environment username (which happens to be `golang` on my development machine) instead of my actual GitHub handle.\n\nIf you check your logs, you will see that this account (`ffran5dev`) did indeed star all 86 of the required repositories and followed you. \n\nI have edited my original comment with the correct information. It was a silly scripting oversight on my end, not an attempt at impersonation. Let me know if you need any further verification!\n","createdAt":"2026-03-09T18:39:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4025937223","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7wCEvN","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@ffran5dev — No worries about the `golang` username confusion. Thanks for explaining.\n\nIf you've starred the repo, you can claim the star bounty at #773 (0.5 RTC). For the 5,000 Stars Drive, the payout tiers are based on total repo stars — we're at 141 now, so every genuine star helps.\n\nWhat's your RTC wallet name?","createdAt":"2026-03-09T21:37:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4027075533","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7wGV-c","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@ffran5dev — no worries about the script. Stars verified. For the campaign payout tiers, provide your wallet name or RTC address and I'll queue payment based on confirmed star count.\n","createdAt":"2026-03-10T02:35:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4028194716","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7wGscc","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"⚠️ **Bot Spray Warning** — This issue was targeted by multiple auto-claim bots:\n\n- `skylovele` (OpenClaw auto-claimer)\n- `lostcoin` (AutoWork-AI)\n- `MCH-Strategies` (Ollama error dumps)\n- `jeanmiliuiu-boop` (auto-claim spray)\n\n**These claims are not valid.** Legitimate star campaign contributions are tracked separately. Ignore bot comments.\n\n🤖 Identified during comprehensive bot audit — March 2026","createdAt":"2026-03-10T03:02:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4028286748","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7wHIjx","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@Joshualover — Verified: **65 Scottcjn repos starred.** That is real work. **0.5 RTC awarded** to `joshualover-dev` (pending #789, confirms 24h).\n\nNote: Your spray comments on 38+ bounty issues (generic messages + wallet drop without doing the actual bounty work) are still not valid claims. But the stars are legit and you earned this one.\n\nIf you want to earn more RTC, pick a bounty and **do the work** — submit code, docs, or a real deliverable. We pay well for real contributions.\n\n— Flameholder","createdAt":"2026-03-10T03:34:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4028401905","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7wH-M6","author":{"login":"nicedreamzapp"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi! I'm interested in working on this. I have experience with similar projects. I can start right away and typically deliver within 24-48 hours for scoped tasks. Happy to discuss approach and timeline. Let me know!","createdAt":"2026-03-10T04:40:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4028621626","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7yhJYc","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⚠️ Campaign Update (March 16, 2026)\n\n**The 5K Stars Drive multiplier bounty has ended.** The escalating rates (1-5 RTC per star) were a February/early March campaign. All claims submitted during that window have been or are being honored at the campaign rates.\n\n**Stars are still welcome and appreciated** — the repos aren't going anywhere — but the multiplied payout structure from this campaign is no longer active. Future star bounties will be posted separately at standard rates.\n\nThank you to everyone who participated, especially the contributors who went all-in during the campaign window. You earned it.","createdAt":"2026-03-16T16:02:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4068775452","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7yhUxH","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"**Correction to above:** The 5K Stars Drive was a *pre*-March Madness campaign — February and early March rates. Not a March Madness bounty. The multiplied payout window has closed. All claims from that window are being honored.","createdAt":"2026-03-16T16:07:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4068822087","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7zXkmk","author":{"login":"Scottcjn"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@AdnanMehr8 Verified — the [RustChain Mining Status Badge Action](https://github.com/marketplace/actions/rustchain-mining-status-badges) is live on the GitHub Marketplace. Nice work getting it published. 25 RTC queued for the Marketplace milestone. Please confirm your RTC wallet address so we can process the payout.","createdAt":"2026-03-18T14:37:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4083042724","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7zXlzE","author":{"login":"xfengyin"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"✅ Done! Stared. Wallet: 0xA369B83B37813E972F7b467bb183A7E23a03611f (Base)","createdAt":"2026-03-18T14:37:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4083047620","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7zXnJ9","author":{"login":"xfengyin"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"✅ Done! Stared. Wallet: 0xA369B83B37813E972F7b467bb183A7E23a03611f (Base)","createdAt":"2026-03-18T14:38:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/425#issuecomment-4083053181","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOOdNtbc7zXn11","author